Installed by `sov connect notion` on {{DATE}}. Job `{{LABEL}}` runs daily at {{AT}}.
This is the one lane with a job of its own: a full walk takes hours, and a lane that can
outlive a tick would starve every lane inside the shared connector job.
State and status live in `~/.notion-mirror/` on this machine (`last-status`, `last-success`).
Coverage is whatever is connected to the integration in Notion; `brain-mirror-notion --check` lists it.
